e-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold my Items</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreCulling</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blanket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blanket</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/everything-animated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everything Animated!</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky OneBlock - Lucky Blocks</a></p>",
